OL,3,AHolly Humberstone: People can't connect
OL,4,Ato a pop star who's 'too polished'
OL,5,
OL,6,FYou might know her as a pop star,
OL,7,Fendorsed by everyone from Taylor Swift
OL,8,Fto Sam Fender, but Holly Humberstone
OL,9,Fhas a secret double life.
OL,11,FIn her spare time, the
OL,12,Fsinger-songwriter is literally a cat
OL,13,Fburglar.
OL,15,F"We've stolen one of our neighbours'
OL,16,Fcats by accident," she laughs, in a
OL,17,FZoom call from her fixer-upper in New
OL,18,FCross, south-east London.
OL,20,F"He's a tiny little black cat who's
OL,21,Fcome into our garden and simply chosen
OL,22,Fus."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/18
