OL,3,AAlleged Russell Brand rape victim wants
OL,4,Aage of consent law changed
OL,5,
OL,6,FWarning - this story contains graphic
OL,7,Fcontent
OL,9,FA woman who alleges that she was raped
OL,10,Fby Russell Brand when she was 16 has
OL,11,Fwaived her right to anonymity and is
OL,12,Fcampaigning for a staggered age of
OL,13,Fconsent in an interview with the Sunday
OL,14,FTimes.
OL,16,FMia Latter was one of six women who
OL,17,Fmade allegations against Brand in 2023
OL,18,Fas part of a Times, Sunday Times and
OL,19,FChannel 4's Dispatches investigation.
OL,20,FShe was known under the pseudonym
OL,21,F'Alice'. Brand denied the allegations
OL,22,Fat the time.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/18
